"Twin coral" = "双子の珊瑚";
"Visit both recursive branches, restore their parent pose and reflect the whole tree." = "再帰の二つの枝を訪ね、親の状態に戻って木全体を反転させよう。";
"Two branching crowns share a center; each has lengths 8, 6, 4 and 2." = "二つの枝分かれした冠は中心を共有し、長さは 8、6、4、2 です。";
"Give each child the same return contract. Rotate only after the complete tree returns." = "二つの子が同じ戻り方を守り、木全体が戻ってから回転しましょう。";
"Counterturn medallion" = "逆回りの紋章";
"Exchange rectangle dimensions and turn direction through mutual recursion." = "相互再帰で長方形の寸法と周回方向を交換しよう。";
"Four sectors overlap at the center. Within a sector, successive loops turn in opposite directions." = "四区画は中心で重なり、区画内の隣り合う輪は逆向きに回ります。";
"Use two procedures with exchanged, reduced dimensions; verify the sector’s heading before reuse." = "二つの手続きで寸法を交換して縮め、再利用の前に区画の最後の向きを確かめましょう。";
"Lantern halo" = "灯籠の光輪";
"Build patterns within patterns" = "模様の中の模様";
"Nest a centered window routine inside a two-window sector and a fourfold repeater." = "中央に戻る窓を二窓の区画に入れ、四回の反復へ渡そう。";
"Eight square windows surround a spacious central court; cardinal and corner windows alternate." = "八つの四角い窓が広い中央の庭を囲み、軸上と角の窓が交互に並びます。";
"Separate the window’s return contract from the sector’s translation and quarter-turn contract." = "窓が元へ戻る条件と、区画の移動と四分の一回転の条件を分けましょう。";
"Woven vortices" = "織りなす渦";
"Exchange two numeric roles and a turn argument while unfolding four returning vortices." = "二つの数値の役割と回転引数を交換し、中心に戻る四つの渦を展開しよう。";
"Horizontal reaches alternate 8, 4, 6, 2; the other dimension advances one cell per two count units." = "横の幅は 8、4、6、2 と変わり、もう一方は二つの数につき一マス進みます。";
"Keep the two counters distinct. After the child returns, undo the parent using its original arguments." = "二つの数え方を分け、子から戻った後は親の元の引数で逆に戻りましょう。";
"Recursive lantern" = "再帰の灯宮";
"Assemble four rotated subcurves by swapping two turn parameters at each level." = "各段で二つの回転引数を交換し、四つの回転した曲線をつなごう。";
"The pattern has four similar quarters, each made from four smaller quarters." = "模様には似た四区画があり、それぞれも小さな四区画でできています。";
"Use depth and two opposite turns. The first and fourth subcalls exchange the turns; three two-cell links join them." = "深さと逆向きの二回転を渡し、一つ目と四つ目の子で回転を交換。二マスの三本の線で結びましょう。";
"Snowmelt seal" = "雪解けの印";
"Grow an instruction motif recursively, then execute only the selected expansion level." = "命令の模様を再帰で育て、選んだ段階の展開だけを実行しよう。";
"Each straight segment becomes five segments with right, left, left, right turns. Four trap caps forbid overrunning the folds." = "各直線は五区間になり、右、左、左、右と回転します。四つの罠の端では進み過ぎに注意。";
"Carry the expanded instruction as a parameter. A second numeric guard selects the deepest layer before fourfold rotation." = "展開した命令を引数にし、二つ目の数値条件で最深段を選び、四方向に回転させましょう。";
"Lantern atlas" = "灯窓の地図";
"Place four recursive copies at offsets, using depth and spacing as independent parameters." = "深さと間隔を別々に制御し、四つの再帰模様をずらして配置しよう。";
"Four large corner groups contain four smaller groups; each connector must be retraced." = "四つの大きな角の組に、四つの小さな組があり、接続線は引き返します。";
"Factor a corner trip that returns rotated by a quarter turn; repeat it four times and reduce spacing by three in each child." = "角へ行って戻り、四分の一回転する手続きを四回使い、子の間隔を三減らしましょう。";
"Dragon gallery" = "ドラゴンの回廊";
"Compose recursive systems" = "再帰を組み合わせる";
"Use two mutually recursive turns to generate a folding curve rather than a repeated tile." = "単位の反復ではなく、二種類の相互再帰で折り畳み曲線を作ろう。";
"The two halves have related folds, but their turns are ordered differently." = "前後の折り方は関連しますが、回転の順序が違います。";
"One procedure expands A, right, B, walk, right; its partner expands left, walk, A, left, B." = "一方は A、右、B、前進、右、もう一方は左、前進、A、左、B と展開します。";
"Dragon compass" = "竜紋の羅針盤";
"Construct inverse recursive procedures so a folded curve returns before its next rotation." = "再帰の逆手続きを作り、折り畳み曲線を戻ってから回転させよう。";
"Four folded arms share a center. Finishing a curve does not automatically restore its starting pose." = "四つの折れた腕は中心を共有しますが、曲線の終わりでは元の位置と向きに戻りません。";
"Reverse the order of each recursive body and exchange left with right; surround the inverse trip with half turns." = "各再帰の本体を逆順にし、左右を交換。逆の道筋の前後で半回転しましょう。";
"Chiral canopy" = "回転する樹冠";
"Combine a branching return invariant with chirality passed through four recursive levels." = "枝分かれから戻る条件と、四段に渡す回転方向を組み合わせよう。";
"The same branch is reflected differently in its two children, then reused in four directions." = "同じ枝でも二つの子では反転が違い、さらに四方向へ使います。";
"Pass depth, stem length and a turn. Reverse the turn for one child; return to the parent pose after both children." = "深さ、幹の長さ、回転を渡し、一方の子で回転を反転。両方の後で親の状態へ戻りましょう。";
"Vaulted mosaic" = "丸天井のモザイク";
"Nest window, row, shrinking tier and rotation routines, each with its own return invariant." = "窓、行、縮む段、回転を入れ子にし、それぞれ元に戻る条件を保とう。";
"Each sector has three tiers: three large windows, two medium windows, one small window." = "各区画は三段で、大窓三つ、中窓二つ、小窓一つです。";
"Let the row recurse sideways and unwind back; let the tier recurse upward and unwind down, then rotate the whole sector." = "行は横へ再帰して戻り、段は上へ再帰して下へ戻り、最後に区画全体を回転させましょう。";
"Astral cathedral" = "星空の聖堂";
"Compose a window generator with a chiral branching tree and a higher-order rotation routine." = "窓枠、回転する分岐木、高階の回転手続きを組み合わせよう。";
"Every node is both a square courtyard and a branch junction; depth, size and chirality change independently." = "各節は四角い庭でも分岐点でもあり、深さ、寸法、回転方向が別々に変わります。";
"Prove the courtyard and each subtree return to the same pose. Build one sector from those contracts, then pass it to a fourfold repeater." = "庭と各部分木が元の状態へ戻ることを確認し、一つの区画を組み立てて四回反復へ渡しましょう。";
"Moore's nexus" = "ムーアの環";
"Advanced fractal topology" = "高次フラクタル幾何";
"Weave a closed space-filling loop across four quadrants by linking rotated Hilbert quarters." = "回転させた四つのヒルベルト曲線を結び、四象限を巡る閉じた空間充填ループを織ろう。";
"Unlike the open Hilbert curve where start and end lie in opposite corners, the Moore curve forms an unbroken closed loop with 4-fold rotational symmetry returning to its origin." = "始点と終点が対角にあるヒルベルト曲線とは異なり、ムーア曲線は四回対称の閉じた環となり元の位置へ戻ります。";
"Factor a recursive Hilbert subcurve with turn-swapping, then embed it into a fourfold repeater with connector links." = "回転を入れ替える再帰ヒルベルト曲線を抽出し、接続歩数とともに四回反復手続きへ埋め込みましょう。";
"Twin dragon bough" = "双子の竜紋";
"Traverse two interlocking fractal dragon arms with 180-degree point symmetry." = "180度の点対称を持つ二組の自己相似な竜紋を巡ろう。";
"The board exhibits pure 2-fold central inversion symmetry: every feature in the northern quadrant has an identical counterpart rotated 180 degrees into the southern quadrant." = "盤面は厳密な二回点対称を持ちます：北側の構造は180度回転すると南側にそのまま対応します。";
"Build an asymmetric tree arm with dynamic turn inversion rrT, then pass it as an embedded argument to a two-fold inverter procedure." = "動的回転反転 rrT を持つ非対称な枝を作り、二回反転手続きへ引数として埋め込みましょう。";
"Mirrored canopy" = "双翼の神樹";
"Generate a bilateral fractal canopy with pure vertical mirror symmetry across the central axis." = "中央軸に対して完全な左右線対称を持つ双翼のフラクタル樹冠を生成しよう。";
"The pattern possesses exact bilateral reflection symmetry: the left wing is a mirror reflection of the right wing across the vertical line x=12." = "模様は厳密な左右線対称を持ちます：左の翼は垂直軸 x=12 を挟んで右の翼と鏡映になっています。";
"Define a recursive branching arm, then pass mirrored calls with opposing chiral turns into a higher-order dual dispatcher." = "再帰的な分岐手続きを定義し、左右逆の回転を渡した二つの呼び出しを高階手続きへ埋め込みましょう。";
"Peano meander" = "ペアノの迷路";
"Traverse a space-filling serpentine meander spanning four symmetric quadrants." = "四つの対称な象限を巡る蛇行空間充填回廊を走破しよう。";
"The nested serpentine meander divides space recursively, preserving 4-fold rotational symmetry around the center." = "入れ子状の蛇行回廊は空間を再帰的に細分し、中心の周りで四回回転対称を保ちます。";
"Compose serpentine folds with inward parameter decay, and drive it through an embedded call inside a fourfold repeater." = "歩数を減らす蛇行折れ曲がりを組み立て、四回反復の中の埋め込み呼び出しで実行しましょう。";
"Koch snowflake star" = "雪晶の星陣";
"Synthesize an 8-fold dihedral fractal snowflake star with multi-level triangular promontories." = "八面体対称を持つ多段の三角形コッホ雪片星陣を合成しよう。";
"The snowflake exhibits full 8-fold dihedral symmetry (D4), combining 4-fold rotation with diagonal and axial reflections." = "雪片は完全な八面体対称（D4）を示し、四回回転に対角・軸対称が重なっています。";
"Branch each arm recursively into dual sub-arms with opposite chiral turns, then wrap in an embedded fourfold dispatcher." = "各光線を逆向きの二つの小枝へと再帰分岐させ、四回分発手続きへ埋め込んで包みましょう。";
"Fibonacci bough" = "フィボナッチの樹";
"Grandmaster recursive synthesis" = "超高難度再帰と総合設計";
"Master asymmetric tree recursion: traverse unbalanced N-1 and N-2 subtrees and restore caller pose." = "非対称な樹状再帰を習得しよう：深さ N-1 と N-2 の異なる部分木を巡り、親の状態へ完全に復帰しよう。";
"A Fibonacci tree branches with different decay rates: the left branch recurses with N-1 while the right recurses with N-2." = "フィボナッチ木は左右で減衰速度が異なり、左は N-1、右は N-2 で再帰します。";
"The return path cannot mirror a uniform child. Explicitly retrace distance D after both subtrees finish, wrapped in an embedded call." = "戻り道は対称になりません。両方の枝の後で距離 D を引き返し、四回反復へ埋め込みましょう。";
"Dual-rate pendulum" = "複動の振り子";
"Interleave two independent clock frequencies to weave a poly-periodic harmonic lattice." = "二つの独立した周期を連動させ、多重周期の調和格子を織り上げよう。";
"Two counters decrementing at different rates trigger staggered termination conditions while preserving exact return invariants." = "異なる速度で減る二つの計数引数が互い違いの終了を起こしつつ、正確な引き返し条件を保ちます。";
"Maintain dual parameters A and B with chiral turn inversion, retrace along the conjugate path, and embed in a fourfold repeater." = "引数 A と B および回転反転を保ち、共役な経路で引き返して、四回反復へ埋め込みましょう。";
"Hanoi ribbon" = "ハノイの織帯";
"Execute a binary reflected Gray code sequence, recursing through inner chambers before each pivot step." = "二進反射グレイコードの順序に従い、軸となる前進の前に内部ループを再帰走破しよう。";
"The classic Tower of Hanoi sequence visits states without redundant passes: G(N) expands into G(N-1), step, G(N-1)." = "ハノイの塔の数列は重複なく状態を巡ります：G(N) は G(N-1)、前進、G(N-1) へ展開されます。";
"Procedure g(N, T) calls g(N-1, rrT), advances b(N), executes turn T, calls g(N-1, T), and unwinds b(N), embedded in a dispatcher." = "手続き g(N, T) は g(N-1, rrT) を呼び、b(N) 進んで T を曲がり、g(N-1, T) を呼び、b(N) を戻る処理を埋め込みましょう。";
"Octagram mandala" = "八荒の星曼荼羅";
"Harmonize cardinal steps and diagonal staircase walkers across three concentric octagonal tiers with 8-fold dihedral symmetry." = "直線歩行と対角階段歩行を調和させ、完全な八面体対称で三重の同心八角星陣を巡ろう。";
"Four cardinal spokes and four diagonal stair rays radiate simultaneously, creating an 8-fold dihedral (D4) star polygon." = "四本の主軸と四本の対角階段が同時に広がり、八面体対称（D4）の星形多角形を形成します。";
"Pair cardinal walk b(S) with diagonal stair d(N), retrace each symmetrically, and invoke via mutually recursive embedded dispatcher a(N,S):q(m(N,S)r)." = "直線 b(S) と対角階段 d(N) を組んで引き返し、相互再帰の埋め込み手続き a(N,S):q(m(N,S)r) で呼び出しましょう。";
"Celestial armillary" = "終局の天球儀";
"Synthesize concentric courtyards, asymmetric Fibonacci spires, and orbital rotations into a grandmaster capstone." = "同心の庭、非対称フィボナッチの樹、軌道回転を統合し、終局の天球儀を完成させよう。";
"Four quadrants each contain a courtyard chamber and an unbalanced asymmetric recursive spire branching into deep space." = "四つの象限のそれぞれに四角い庭と、外側へ伸びる非对称な再帰の樹があります。";
"Compose courtyard generator c(W), Fibonacci tree f(N, D, T), and sector orchestrator a(N, D, T), driven by an embedded call inside repeater q." = "庭 c(W)、フィボナッチの樹 f(N, D, T)、区画統括 a(N, D, T) を組み合わせ、反復 q 内の埋め込み呼び出しで駆動しましょう。";
"Alternating mirror halls" = "交互の鏡回廊";
"Transformations and inverse paths" = "変換と逆の道筋";
"Swap shrinking rectangle dimensions and chirality while restoring every entrance pose." = "縮む長方形の二寸法と回転方向を交換し、各段で入口の位置と向きへ戻ろう。";
"Each quadrant contains three offset rectangles. Their long side changes direction at the next level." = "各区画にはずれた三段の長方形があり、次の段で長辺の方向が入れ替わります。";
"Separate the closed rectangle from its two-part connector. Swap width, height and turns only in the child, then undo the connector." = "閉じる長方形と二つの接続区間を分け、子で幅・高さ・左右を交換し、接続を戻りましょう。";
"Paired folding ribbons" = "対になる折り帯";
"Grow a forward instruction and its inverse together, then execute one selected expansion." = "順方向と逆方向の命令を同時に育て、選んだ段だけ実行して先端の窓を巡ろう。";
"Four folded arms end in square loops. The return must undo the folds in reverse order." = "四本の折り帯の先端には四角い窓があり、戻りは折れ目の逆順です。";
"Carry two instruction parameters. If the next forward path is X-right-Y, its inverse is X-left-Y; use a separate numeric guard to execute the final pair." = "二つの命令引数を渡し、新しい順路が X・右・Y なら逆路は X・左・Y。別の数値条件で最後の対だけ実行しましょう。";
"Counterchanging windows" = "寸法が交差する窓";
"Coordinate shrinking widths, growing heights and row offsets with separate return invariants." = "窓ごとに狭く高くし、行のずれも制御して、行と段の復帰条件を守ろう。";
"Each row has three windows. Moving right reduces width and increases height; the next row starts narrower and taller." = "各行は三窓。右へ進むと幅が一減り高さが一増え、上の行の最初の窓も狭く高くなります。";
"Make a rectangle return to its corner, a row return along its changing spacings, and the outer recursion restore each seven-cell rise." = "窓を角へ戻し、行を変わる間隔に沿って戻し、外側の再帰で七マスの上昇を戻しましょう。";
"Counterpoised organ" = "折り返すオルガン";
"Alternate branch sides as reach shrinks and the terminal window grows, then unwind the central spine." = "軸に沿って左右交互に枝を伸ばし、腕を短く窓を大きくして、段ごとに戻ろう。";
"Along an arm, side reaches are five, four and three cells while window sides are one, two and three." = "一つの主軸で側枝は五・四・三マス、窓の辺は一・二・三マスになります。";
"Keep depth, reach and window size independent. Finish each side trip before advancing the spine; invert the turn only for the child." = "深さ・腕の長さ・窓幅を別に渡し、横の往復後に軸を進み、子の回転だけ反転しましょう。";
"Lantern curve workshop" = "曲線の灯り工房";
"Replace each recursive curve link with a reusable window-and-walk instruction without changing its pose contract." = "再帰曲線の接続歩行を窓と前進の命令に置き換え、部分曲線の状態条件を守ろう。";
"Small square windows follow a larger folded curve. The connector has the same net displacement as a three-cell walk." = "小さな四角い窓が大きな折り線に沿い、各接続単位の変位は三マス前進と同じです。";
"Pass the window-and-walk as an instruction argument to the curve. Its closed window must restore heading before the three-cell link." = "窓と前進を命令引数として曲線へ渡し、窓で向きを戻してから三マスを進みましょう。";
"Diagonal homecoming" = "斜めの枝の帰路";
"Layered recursive synthesis" = "多層再帰の総合";
"Build inverse stair walkers and reuse them through unequal, mirrored recursive branches." = "階段歩行の逆手続きを作り、深さと回転が異なる再帰の枝で再利用しよう。";
"Branches move diagonally with stair steps. Repeating the forward stair after a half turn does not retrace it." = "枝は階段で斜めに進み、半回転して同じ階段を繰り返しても元のマスを戻れません。";
"Reverse the stair unit and exchange its turns. Give each subtree a returning pose contract before combining depths N-1 and N-2." = "階段単位を逆順にして左右を交換し、各部分木の復帰を確認して N-1 と N-2 の深さを組み合わせましょう。";
"Branching courtyards" = "枝分かれする中庭";
"Place unequal recursive courtyards at alternating corners, with swapped dimensions and chirality." = "交互の角に異なる縮小規則の再帰の庭を置き、二寸法と回転方向を交換しよう。";
"A large rectangular circuit holds a child at each corner. Adjacent children shrink different dimensions." = "大きな長方形の各角に子の庭があり、隣同士で幅と高さの減らし方が異なります。";
"Factor a two-corner half circuit and repeat it twice. Each child must close at its own corner before the parent continues." = "二つの角を巡る半周を二回使い、子の庭をその角で閉じてから親を進めましょう。";
"Layered lantern vault" = "段々に変わる灯りの天井";
"Nest returning windows inside shrinking rows while window size grows between tiers." = "戻れる入れ子の窓を短くなる行へ組み込み、段が減るほど最初の窓を大きくしよう。";
"The tiers have three, two and one windows. Within a row they shrink; between rows the first window grows." = "三段の窓数は三・二・一。行の中では窓が縮み、上の段の最初の窓は大きくなります。";
"Give inner nesting, sideways translation and upward translation separate recursions; all three must undo their displacement." = "窓の入れ子、横の移動、上の段への移動を別々に再帰させ、三つとも変位を戻しましょう。";
"Returning star atlas" = "星図からの帰還";
"Dock with four decorated recursive curves and construct the inverse of both the curve and its link motif." = "窓で飾る四つの再帰星図へ接続し、曲線と接続単位の両方の逆路を作ろう。";
"Each quadrant has a folded panel. A square at the far end must be visited before retracing to the shared center." = "各区画に折り線の窓があり、奥の窓を巡って共通の中心へ戻ってから回転します。";
"Invert a decorated link by walking first and drawing the mirrored square afterward. Use reversed turn arguments for the return curve." = "飾る接続単位の逆路は先に歩き、次に逆向きの窓を描き、帰りの曲線では二つの回転引数も交換しましょう。";
"Palace of woven paths" = "道を織る宮殿";
"Combine inverse diagonal trunks, unequal subtrees and exchanged node motifs into one returning recursive system." = "斜めの幹と逆路、深さの違う部分木、交換する節の模様を統合し、元に戻る再帰系を作ろう。";
"Square and diamond nodes share diagonal branches. One child exchanges the two motifs and the turns; its sibling retains them." = "四角と菱形の節が斜めの枝を共有し、一方の子では模様と左右を交換し、もう一方は保ちます。";
"Make both node instructions close at their entry pose. Pass them alongside depth, stride and turns, and retrace each stair trunk after both children." = "二つの節の命令を入口で閉じ、深さ・歩数・回転と共に渡し、両方の子の後で階段の幹を逆に戻りましょう。";
